        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🐾 <u>Critters Breakout is pure chaotic chase energy</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/2d07648e77e690a95b7da84d458a9a28.poster.avif?t=1787743706\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/2d07648e77e690a95b7da84d458a9a28.webm?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/2d07648e77e690a95b7da84d458a9a28.mp4?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as adorable Critters fighting for freedom…<br>or become the unstoppable Kollectors hunting them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match turns into a fast, funny, unpredictable chase across wild maps where anything can happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🧠 <u>Two sides. One goal: SURVIVE or CAPTURE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Critters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/c8ef78e6aba8969f61dd4cba318f5138.poster.avif?t=1787743706\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/c8ef78e6aba8969f61dd4cba318f5138.webm?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/c8ef78e6aba8969f61dd4cba318f5138.mp4?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build generator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart your hunters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>But survival is never simple.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Every 2 minutes, new item chests drop into the map, giving Critters a chance to turn the match around with wild powers like:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Grow</u></strong> — become bigger and harder to deal with.<br><strong><u>Space Jump</u></strong> — launch into the air and escape danger.<br><strong><u>Fast Speed</u></strong> — move quicker and create distance.<br><strong><u>Disguise</u></strong> — hide in plain sight and confuse the Kollectors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Kollectors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/989eb683cecb22e580359229116d7aed.poster.avif?t=1787743706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/989eb683cecb22e580359229116d7aed.webm?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/989eb683cecb22e580359229116d7aed.mp4?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track and chase Critters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shut down every escape attempt</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Kollectors can also grab powerful chest items, including:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fake Portal</strong> — trick Critters with a dangerous decoy.<br><strong>Invisibility</strong> — disappear from sight and strike when they least expect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⚡ <u>Fast matches. Funny moments. Pure chaos.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/5186de87e12766c1dae2ade45aeca78e.poster.avif?t=1787743706\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/5186de87e12766c1dae2ade45aeca78e.webm?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/5186de87e12766c1dae2ade45aeca78e.mp4?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment you're escaping…<br>the next you're trapped…<br>then suddenly, someone saves you in the most unexpected way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🐾 <u>Made with love (and for a cause)</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/59809ef243617c01b2228ee924cbb8a6.poster.avif?t=1787743706\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/59809ef243617c01b2228ee924cbb8a6.webm?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961980/extras/59809ef243617c01b2228ee924cbb8a6.mp4?t=1787743706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critters Breakout is a Pinoy-made game that helps support animal shelters as the community grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
